### 创建文档（两步式：先调 /system/file/upload 拿文件编号与下载链接，再保存文档）
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledgeBaseId": 1,
  "fileId": 1,
  "fileUrl": "/api/system/file/download?id=1"
}

### 分页查询文档（可按知识库、标题、状态收窄）
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&knowledgeBaseId=1&status=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取文档详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 重试入库（仅失败文档，回到「排队」重新执行）
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/retry?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除文档（不可恢复）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/doc/delete?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
